Here is the study in JSON format with logical operators:

```
{
  "AND": {
    "left": {
      "NOT": {
        "left": {
          "OR": {
            "left": {
              "raw_text": "Patients who were pregnant"
            },
            "right": {
              "raw_text": "or nursing"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "right": {
      "NOT": {
        "left": {
          "raw_text": "or not able to give written informed consent"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

This JSON represents the following logical expression:

"Not (pregnant or nursing) and not not able to give written informed consent"

In other words, patients who are pregnant, nursing, or unable to give written informed consent are excluded from the study.